- Evening and night shift allowances of 130% (6:00 PM – 10:00 PM) and 140% (10:00 PM – 7:00 AM);
- Temporary contract with the possibility of a permanent position;
- Flexible hours: work between 24 and 36 hours per week;
- 8% holiday allowance and 24 vacation days;
- Travel allowance from 10 km, up to €8.32 per day;
- Internal training and career advancement opportunities, such as becoming a team leader or operator.

